  "description": "Oswald Quinton, heir to a powerful military company, is well-known for his successful career but also for his brutal personality, a result of his troubled childhood. As Oswald discovers the significance of \"Amon,\" a mineral crucial for his company's survival, he ventures to strike a deal with the landowner who possesses the land containing the vital resource. Initially resistant to selling, the landowner finally agrees under one condition: Oswald must help the landowner's daughter, Yoo Dan-Hee, rediscover the joys of life. Dan-Hee, scarred by her failed marriage, has lost her ability to love. As their paths converge, how will their relationship evolve?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
